Description: OpenSCAP compliance scanning for Cockpit
 Evaluate the system against SCAP Security Guide profiles (CIS, STIG, PCI DSS,
 ANSSI, ...), browse results rule by rule, customize profiles with tailoring,
 apply guided remediation and schedule unattended scans, all from the Cockpit
 web console.
